{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"norway-parental-benefit-planner UI copy.limits","detected_language":"jv","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"norway-parental-benefit-planner.copy.limits","keys":["norway-parental-benefit-planner.copy.limits"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Norway kawai. Wannan wani taimakon shirye-shirye ne, ba wani hukuncin da ya dace ba, ƙididdiga na biyan riba, ƙayyade haƙƙoƙin izinin mai aiki ko aikace-aikacen NAV. Taswirar ƙa'ida tana tsammanin iyaye biyu sun samu haƙƙi. Ayyukan ƙa'idodin, matsalolin iyaye guda, haihuwar farko, cuta, canje-canje na izinin lokaci guda, haɗin gwiwa tsakanin iyakoki da ƙididdiga na riba na mutum na iya canza sakamakon; bincika NAV don waɗannan matsalolin.","record_id":"6354d6e40d05bbec9973fb4b5ff56182f361deac2736781fa98e1b5c61dea495","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.7864410171250142,"source":"Norway only. This is a planning aid, not an eligibility decision, benefit-payment calculation, employer leave-rights determination or NAV application. The standard table assumes both parents have earned a right. Activity rules, one-parent cases, early birth, illness, simultaneous leave exceptions, cross-border coordination and individualized income calculations can change the result; check NAV for those cases.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"01af0f01159b36ffbaedfb0e35b6ff157c04d702a41dce765ef3fa9667c0ed88","status":"needs-review","translation":"Norway kawai. Wannan wani taimakon shirye-shirye ne, ba wani hukuncin da ya dace ba, ƙididdiga na biyan riba, ƙayyade haƙƙoƙin izinin mai aiki ko aikace-aikacen NAV. Taswirar ƙa'ida tana tsammanin iyaye biyu sun samu haƙƙi. Ayyukan ƙa'idodin, matsalolin iyaye guda, haihuwar farko, cuta, canje-canje